  "summary_md": "**Vlad Erium 🇯🇵 ([@ssh4net](https://x.com/ssh4net/status/2116120747466977608))** shares *Neural Explicit Shape Representation* ([arXiv 2610.38441](https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.38441)) from Peking University, introducing **NeuOctree**, which predicts ray–surface intersections with normal and albedo for direct ray tracing and compression; code is announced but not yet live ([octree-nn/neural-octree](https://github.com/octree-nn/neural-octree)).",
